#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat"
msgstr "聊天室"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/chat.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat — 离线发送与多端冲突"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:8
msgid ""
"Chat SPA 支持 **离线写入 outbox**、上线后 **自动重试**，并通过 Hub 侧幂等与 "
"tail CAS 避免重复发送与陈旧消息。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/chat.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "客户端"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:15
msgid ""
"发送先入 IndexedDB `outbox`（`moduleId: chat`），并乐观显示 user bubble"
"（`sendStatus: pending`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:15
msgid "离线时可输入并发送；消息排队，Hub 恢复后按 FIFO 重试。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:15
msgid "重试前调用 `conversation.tail` 对比入队时的 `expected_tail_pos`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:15
msgid ""
"**tail 不一致**（会话已在别端继续）：标记 `stale`，默认不发送；用户可 **丢弃"
"** 或 **仍要发送**（`force_tail`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/chat.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub 协议"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:19
msgid "`message.send` 可选字段："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 字段                | 说明                                 |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `client_op_id`      | 幂等键；重复请求不重复写入 user 消息 |\n"
"| `expected_tail_pos` | 发送时观测的 `max(pos)`，空会话为 0  |\n"
"| `force_tail`        | 跳过 CAS，追加到当前末尾             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:27
msgid "`conversation.tail` 返回 `{ tail_pos, tail_role?, updated_at? }`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:29
msgid "流错误 `code`："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:31
msgid "`tail_conflict` — CAS 失败"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:33
msgid "幂等短路（`client_op_id` 已提供时）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:36
msgid ""
"turn **已完成**（该 user 后已有非空 assistant）→ 直接 `accepted` + `done`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/chat.md:36
msgid ""
"turn **进行中**（同 `client_op_id` 已占用）→ 直接 `accepted` + `done`，**不 "
"preempt / 不重跑**（避免弱网下在线发送与 outbox flush 并发触发两轮）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:38
msgid ""
"客户端：在线 `dispatchSend` 期间对 outbox op 做进程内 claim，flush preflight "
"跳过已 claim 的条目；`flushOfflineModule` 与全局 sync 共用锁。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/chat.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "与 Tier 2 离线平台"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/chat.md:41
msgid ""
"Outbox 布局与 [`shell-sdk/offline-outbox`](../../src/frontend/shell-sdk/"
"offline-outbox.ts) 对齐；Chat flush 走 WS 流式 `message.send`，非通用 "
"`hub().call` 单次响应。"
msgstr ""
